<% 
    locals.hideSidebar = (typeof currentUser === 'undefined' || !currentUser);
-%>
<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") -%>

<div class="page-container" style="max-width: 840px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px;">
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 24px;">
        <a href="/" style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13.5px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 500;">
            ← Back to Home
        </a>
        <h1 style="font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 8px 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">Last updated: October 28, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 36px 32px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; font-size: 14.5px;">
        
        <section>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">1. What We Collect</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">We collect the minimum information necessary to match teammates and run TeamForge safely:</p>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
                <li><strong>Account Credentials:</strong> Full name, institutional college email (ending in <code>@kkwagh.edu.in</code>), and password (stored strictly as a salted cryptographic hash using the <code>bcryptjs</code> library with 10 salt rounds; plaintext passwords are never stored or logged).</li>
                <li><strong>Academic & Profile Details:</strong> Department, academic year, skills and proficiency levels, short bio, optional profile photo, and optional phone number.</li>
                <li><strong>External Profiles:</strong> Optional GitHub and LinkedIn details. We only store public profile data and never store access tokens:
                    <ul style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; padding-left: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;">
                        <li><strong>GitHub fields stored:</strong> <code>github</code> (username or link), <code>isGithubVerified</code> (verification status), <code>githubId</code> (numeric profile ID), <code>githubUsername</code> (handle), and <code>githubData</code> containing <code>reposCount</code> (public repository count), <code>totalCommits</code> (aggregate commit count across top repos), <code>languages</code> (detected programming languages), <code>topRepos</code> (repository name, URL, description, star count, primary language, and last updated timestamp), <code>cachedAt</code> (cache timestamp), and <code>rateLimitedUntil</code> (rate limit expiry).</li>
                        <li><strong>LinkedIn fields stored:</strong> <code>linkedin</code> (profile URL), <code>isLinkedinLinked</code> (link status), <code>linkedinId</code> (member identifier), <code>linkedinProfileUrl</code>, and <code>linkedinData</code> containing <code>name</code> (full name), <code>picture</code> (avatar URL), <code>email</code> (verified email), and <code>linkedAt</code> (link timestamp). Profile picture is imported to your profile photo if you have not uploaded a custom one.</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li><strong>Teaming Activity:</strong> Team invitations, applications, notifications, reviews, and feedback.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">2. Why We Collect It</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">We collect your information for specific, legitimate purposes:</p>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
                <li>To match students into hackathon and engineering project teams using transparent criteria.</li>
                <li>To send transactional emails (email verification, password reset, invitations, and deadline reminders).</li>
                <li>To keep the platform safe, verified, and free of spam.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">3. Who Can See It</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Your information is shared with strict privacy controls:</p>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
                <li><strong>Other Students:</strong> Other students see profile details according to your privacy settings. If you toggle "Hide my profile" on your profile edit page, you are excluded from candidate recommendations, candidate search ("Find People"), and the leaderboard, and you cannot receive new team invitations. (The Discover page displays project requirements with open roles, not user profiles).</li>
                <li><strong>Locked Mutual Contact Sharing:</strong> Your email and phone number are shared ONLY with the other person in a locked team match after BOTH of you agree to share contacts. Before mutual consent, contact details remain hidden.</li>
                <li><strong>Administrators:</strong> Campus administrators can view user data strictly for moderation, policy enforcement, and reviewing student organizer applications.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">4. Peer Reviews & Teammate Ratings</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Peer reviews use a double-blind mechanism following hackathon events:</p>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
                <li>A review remains hidden until both teammates submit their reviews for the event.</li>
                <li>Once both teammates submit, both reviews are revealed. <strong>Revealed reviews are shown with the reviewer's name</strong> to the recipient on their reviews dashboard, alongside the event name, date, rating breakdown, and feedback comments. Reviews are not anonymous.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">5. Email Communications</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Transactional emails are delivered via standard SMTP email services solely to send service messages. You can turn off transactional email notifications at any time by unchecking "Receive Email Notifications" on the <strong>Profile Edit page</strong> (<code>/profile/edit</code>). Your email address is never sold and never used for advertising.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">6. Cookies & Sessions</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0;">TeamForge uses only two essential cookies: a session cookie (<code>connect.sid</code>) and a security CSRF cookie (<code>csrfToken</code>). Sessions are stored in the <code>sessions</code> collection in MongoDB and expire after 24 hours. We use no tracking, analytics, or advertising cookies.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">7. How Long We Keep It & Account Deletion</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">We keep your account data while your account exists. There is no automated self-service delete button in the user interface. If you wish to delete your account and personal data, please send an email request to our support address (<a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none;"><%= supportEmail %></a>). We do not promise an exact deletion timeframe; we aim to respond within 7 days.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">8. Data Is Never Sold</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0;">Student data is never sold, rented, or traded under any circumstances.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">9. Contact</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0;">If you have any privacy questions or requests, contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</p>
        </section>

    </div>

</div>
